      "corps_key": "brig-juice-brass",
      "name": "Brig Juice Brass",
      "field": "about",
      "from": "Brig Juice Brass is a Syracuse, New York ensemble listed by SoundSport as a registered 2026 ensemble and by DCI in SoundSport Showcase Rochester materials.",
      "to": "Brig Juice Brass is part of the Brig Juice organization based in the Syracuse, New York area. The organization includes a competitive mini-corps, a non-competitive concert corps, and a holiday brass ensemble, with all-age opportunities for brass players, set drummers, and percussionists. Its public materials describe the concert corps and mini-corps as stand-still brass performance groups that appear at festivals, park concerts, drum corps shows, and DCA-style mini-corps events.",
      "source_url": "https://www.brigjuice.com/"
    },
