      "corps_key": "blue-way-summer-arts-camp",
      "name": "The Blue Way",
      "field": "about",
      "from": "The Blue Way Summer Arts Camp is a North Canton, Ohio ensemble listed by SoundSport as a registered 2026 ensemble and appearing in Bluecoats-hosted DCI event lineups.",
      "to": "The Blue Way Summer Arts Camp is the Bluecoats' summer education program in Northeast Ohio. Hosted around the corps' spring training residency, it offers leadership, performance, and educator tracks for students and teachers, with winds, percussion, color guard, drum major, and music education experiences. Participants rehearse, learn, and in some tracks perform alongside the Bluecoats at the Opening Night Community Celebration.",
      "source_url": "https://bluecoats.com/theblueway"
    },
